tvm-fortran is a modern Fortran translation of the computational routines in
tvm 0.5.2, originally authored by Juan Manuel Truppia.

Original package:
  Package: tvm
  Version: 0.5.2
  Copyright holder: Juan Manuel Truppia
  License: MIT

The unmodified source supplied for translation is retained under
original/tvm-0.5.2 and provenance/tvm-master.zip. The Fortran translation is
provided under the same MIT license.
